From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:04:25 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 122/144] GreatDANE: replace leftover Firefox/Mozilla strings
 in Windows module.ver, manifests, and branding.nsi (round 4f)

Frank leftovers 5-8. Source filenames (firefox.exe.manifest, module.ver) stay;
those are internal. MOZ_APP_DISPLAYNAME / GreatDANE basename are unchanged.

Both module.ver files (browser/app and pbproxy):
- Company is Pepecoin, matching MOZ_APP_VENDOR
- Copyright is Pepecoin, with a factual Mozilla.org credit and the MPL 2 notice
- Trademarks credit Firefox and Mozilla to Mozilla.org and no longer say
  "Firefox is a Trademark of The Mozilla Foundation" as if this binary were Firefox

firefox.exe.manifest assembly name and description are Dane.
desktop-launcher.exe.manifest is Dane.DesktopLauncher / "Desktop launcher for Dane".

branding.nsi (greatdane only):
- URLInfoAbout is https://dane.surf/ (was https://dogecoin.surf)
- HelpLink is https://dane.surf/support/ (verified 200)
- Stub, manual, and system-requirements URLs no longer point at official Firefox
  downloads or installer-help. They use https://dane.surf/download/ and
  https://dane.surf/support/. There is no stable unversioned PE URL; the public
  Windows installer on 2026-11-10 is a versioned unsigned exe, so the stub's
  automatic PE fetch and CertCheck cannot succeed until a signed, stable URL
  exists. URLManualDownload opens the Dane download page.
- CertNameDownload / CertIssuerDownload are Pepecoin, not Mozilla Corporation
  or Mozilla's DigiCert CA. Update both to the real subject CN and issuer when
  Windows signing starts.

Prepared only. Not built, signed, notarized or published.
---
 .../desktop-launcher.exe.manifest             |  4 +--
 browser/app/firefox.exe.manifest              |  4 +--
 browser/app/module.ver                        |  6 ++--
 browser/app/pbproxy/module.ver                |  6 ++--
 browser/branding/greatdane/branding.nsi       | 28 ++++++++++++-------
 5 files changed, 28 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

